     "agendaObjectItemOutlineNumber": "A.",
     "agendaObjectItemName": "Authorize the Mayor, Barbara Smyth, to sign any all agreements, documents and instruments with Axon Enterprise Inc for the sole source purchase of a five-year contract (effective July 1, 2027- June 30,2032) for the installation and<br>maintenance for the purchase of Axon equipment to outfit 75 patrol vehicles with upgraded dashboard cameras, 183 body worn cameras, 187 Taser 10’s electronic systems. 11 License Plate reader cameras, one Virtual reality training<br>system, the FUSUS real-time crime analysis and data center, and a public safety DFR drone as a first responder program and any all-related equipment for an amount not to exceed a total five-year cost of $5,493,446.22.<br><br>(Account # 013049–5258 POLICE OTHER PROFESSIONAL SERVS)<br><br>The yearly cost per fiscal year is as follows:<br><br><u>New proposed contract between City of Norwalk Axon Contract</u><br>Contract Year                                                                            Axon<br>City Of Norwalk / Axon Year 1- 2027-2028                            $ 1,034,965.27<br>City of Norwalk / Axon Year 2-2028-2029                              $ 1,065,728.57<br>City of Norwalk / Axon Year 3-2029-2030                              $ 1,097,590.55<br>City of Norwalk / Axon Year 4-2030-2031                              $ 1,130,551.23<br>City of Norwalk / Axon Year 5- 2031-2032                             $ 1,164,610.60<br>Total Contract Value                                                               $ 5,493,446.22",
     "sortOrder": 14,
     "isSection": 0,
