     "agendaObjectItemName": "Authorize the Mayor, Barbara C. Smyth, to execute a tax abatement agreement with Owner, Sound Communities Inc, owner of 8 Chestnut St. (the “Parcel”), and Developer, SC Leroy LLC, proposed ground lessee of the Parcel under a lease in which Developer will be obligated to construct 68 new construction housing units thereon consisting of extremely low (up to 30% AMI) and very low (up to 50% AMI) income housing units (the “Housing Project”), for annual payment in lieu of taxes. The Tax Year’s PILOT shall be determined by multiplying the aggregate rent collected with respect to the Housing Project for the preceding Tax Year, excluding any rental assistance subsidies, and reduced by the costs of utilities and trash payments paid by the Developer for such Tax Year, by eight percent (8%), for a term of 16 years from the date of completion of the Housing Project as reflected by the issuance of the first certificate of occupancy or temporary certificate of occupancy for the last unit in the Housing Project, or 18 years from the date when all parties have signed the Agreement, whichever occurs first. ",
